### 公告/公示（notice）接口调试脚本（IDEA HTTP Client 直接运行）
# 管理端前缀按网关实际配置（本地直连服务时路径不含 /admin-api）
# 权限码：bidding:notice:query/create/update/publish/delete；大厅公开接口 @PermitAll
@host = http://127.0.0.1:48110
@tenant = 1
@token = 替换为登录后的 access-token

### 1.1 管理端：公告分页（关键字走检索组件，需 bidding.es.enabled=true；未启用且带 keyword 会报 101005）
GET {{host}}/bidding/notice/page?pageNo=1&pageSize=10&noticeType=TENDER_NOTICE&status=PUBLISHED
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.2 大厅公开：公告分页（跨租户、仅已发布/非内部/SOCIAL；不带登录态）
GET {{host}}/bidding/notice/public/list?pageNo=1&pageSize=10&keyword=招标
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### 1.3 大厅公开：关键词全文检索（未启用检索组件时返回 101005 提示）
GET {{host}}/bidding/notice/public/list?pageNo=1&pageSize=10&keyword=安置房
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### 2.1 管理端：公告详情（结构化 payload 全集 + 正文 + pdfFileId）
GET {{host}}/bidding/notice/get?id=1
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.2 大厅公开：公告详情
GET {{host}}/bidding/notice/public/detail?id=1
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### 3 新建公告（草稿；payload 的 key 必须为权威数据集字段英文名，其余自动剔除、缺失自动补 null）
POST {{host}}/bidding/notice/create
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "noticeType": "TENDER_NOTICE",
  "title": "某安置房项目施工招标公告（调试）",
  "projectCode": "E4400002026GD0001",
  "projectName": "某安置房项目",
  "publisherName": "招标人测试单位",
  "publishTime": "2026-09-03 10:00:00",
  "internalFlag": false,
  "publicLevel": "SOCIAL",
  "pdfFileId": 1001,
  "pdfSha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
  "pdfSize": 1048576,
  "payload": {
    "UNIFIED_DEAL_CODE": "E4400002026GD0001",
    "NOTICE_NAME": "某安置房项目施工招标公告（调试）"
  },
  "content": "招标公告正文第一版……"
}

### 4.1 发布（DRAFT→PUBLISHED；校验：正文存在 + PDF 原文件已保存，缺一即报错）
POST {{host}}/bidding/notice/publish?id=1
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4.2 撤下（PUBLISHED→UNPUBLISHED）
POST {{host}}/bidding/notice/unpublish?id=1
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4.3 修改（正文有实质变更自动追加新版本，只追加不覆盖）
PUT {{host}}/bidding/notice/update
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "id": 1,
  "noticeType": "TENDER_NOTICE",
  "title": "某安置房项目施工招标公告（修改版）",
  "content": "招标公告正文第二版（追加版本，不覆盖第一版）……"
}

### 4.4 删除（逻辑删除）
DELETE {{host}}/bidding/notice/delete?id=1
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
